# Applies when building with context agent-core/ and -f zone-a/cognitive-core/Dockerfile.
# Everything is excluded except what the Dockerfile COPYs (keeps rust `target/` dirs etc. out).
*
!shared/proto
!zone-a/cognitive-core
!zone-a/vector-db
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/tests
**/conftest.py
**/.pytest_cache
**/.coverage
zone-a/cognitive-core/Dockerfile*
